{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CesgeGHS18qP5Afa5EHgk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The implementation is complete and all acceptance criteria are met:\n\n## Summary of Changes\n\n✅ **Order Status Management**\n- Added `OrderStatus` enum (ACTIVE, CANCELLED) to Order.kt\n- New orders default to ACTIVE status\n- Status is returned in `GET /orders/{orderId}` responses\n\n✅ **Cancel Endpoint**\n- Implemented `POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel` that:\n  - Returns 404 if order doesn't exist\n  - Returns 200 with the order if already CANCELLED (idempotent)\n  - Moves order to CANCELLED and cancels all CREATED shipments if active\n  - Returns 409 if any shipment is CONFIRMED (all-or-nothing, no changes made)\n\n✅ **Shipment Restrictions**\n- `POST /shipments` now rejects creation for CANCELLED orders with 409 error\n- Existing shipments can still be retrieved for cancelled orders\n\n✅ **Error Handling**\n- Added `ORDER_CANNOT_BE_CANCELLED` error code for CONFIRMED shipment conflicts\n- Added `ORDER_IS_CANCELLED` error code for shipment creation attempts\n- All error responses follow the existing API envelope format\n\n✅ **No Breaking Changes**\n- All 13 existing tests pass\n- No new Maven dependencies added\n- Only modified order and shipment features + shared API package\n- Build succeeds without issues"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1098,"cache_read_input_tokens":44573,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1098},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd3ab782-f892-4304-b7b1-333aa0c8f607","uuid":"e984617a-d36e-40ff-9d9f-f737f773d9e7","timestamp":"2026-09-09T10:10:35.385Z","request_id":"req_011CesgeFhCjkdNDJnaFFw7T"}
